<Article slug="twenty-nine-on-the-register">
  <AssertionCard assertion={register} />
  <p>
    The National Park Service publishes the whole National Register as a map service, and this
    county's share of it is one request. Twenty-nine properties: twenty-six buildings, two
    structures and one historic district, from 15 October 1966 to 27 October 2004. Twenty-five
    are in Lima, two in Delphos, one in Shawnee Township and one in Spencer.
  </p>
